	(descr "MPD BK-916 retainer for 12 mm coin cells (CR1216, CR1220, CR1225), rated -40 to +270 C: land pattern from MPD drawing BK-916 rev E, 10/24/18 (four 2.5 x 2.5 mm tab pads, 17.8 mm overall; round 10.2 mm negative contact pad, no paste). The tab pairs are placed symmetric about the cell center as the drawing's PCB layout shows; the drawing gives no number for that offset. Body 13.80 x 9.60 mm drawn with the chamfered side at -y; cell 12.5 mm on F.Fab; courtyard 0.25 mm beyond pads and the round cell (Andy, 2026-11-11).")
	(tags "coin cell battery holder retainer 1220 1225 1216 MPD BK-916")
